    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "d5bfea49-0733-48ff-9ee0-d83c01a4cbf4",
      "key": "e15982e1-4174-414d-b673-1a49628956cc",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember all of these tours are just our suggestions. Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members. You could:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Estay at hotels with different star ratings\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ewith more (or less) dinners included\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Efor more (or fewer) days\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Einclude different excursions \u2013 see tours for suggestions\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ebring a specialist lecturer\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Einclude all entrance fees \u0026amp; gratuities\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAnd if you have an idea or a destination that we haven\u2019t included here, we can do that too!\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe can tailor make any group tour for as few as 15 people. Simply for ease of reference and consistency, the suggested tours are priced on early season departures with a minimum of 40 paying passengers.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFor smaller or larger groups to your chosen destination with your preferred itinerary and departure date, simply call us on 020 7064 4970 for a tailor made costing.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
